s individually and ensure that your structure has 1 to 3 title sponsors. Depending on the sponsors' wishes and your own, you can choose the number of partners present in your team's name during your seasons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/a74454ebf04423a6f985ba6e7b205c06.webp?t=1769697033\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/d849469e17044a5e5dc60472ac9dff49.poster.avif?t=1769697033\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/d849469e17044a5e5dc60472ac9dff49.webm?t=1769697033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/d849469e17044a5e5dc60472ac9dff49.mp4?t=1769697033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make every game in Pro Cycling Manager 25 unique! Options are now decentralized and specific to each game. You can customize both new difficulty options (financial, level of opponents in the race, sponsor objectives, etc.) and choose game preferences (speed of characteristic evolution, AI sponsor renewal, recovery system and much more). Every game in Pro Cycling Manager is different, and in these, the player becomes master of his or her own game environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/20d7cc4edbefeae93754cce7cf621645.webp?t=1769697033\" width=615 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/566661dab3555c1893f1e382b92ae11d.poster.avif?t=1769697033\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/566661dab3555c1893f1e382b92ae11d.webm?t=1769697033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/extras/566661dab3555c1893f1e382b92ae11d.mp4?t=1769697033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More customized frames and helmets in the colors of the biggest teams<br></li><li>Implementation of the option to rename your backups<br></li><li>Addition of a new team sponsorship summary page<br></li><li>Integration of objectives linked to sponsor membership requests<br></li><li>Added accessibility options <br></li><li>AI with more realistic behavior including better skimming, improved sprint phases, versatile sprinters and teams that better target hilly stages<br></li><li>Promotions and relegations are now based on the team rankings at the end of each season.</li></ul></p>", "short_description": "New graphics for an even more realistic simulation. Become a team manager and lead your riders to the top. Choosing sponsors, recruiting riders, managing the race, it's all up to you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/66be9c6cad0c89939feddda876221f2c5106fac2/header.jpg?t=1769697033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2511310/e5112f3c